<title>一篇样例短文（非官方译文 v1.0）</title>
<style>
body { margin: 0; background: #eee; }
.bl-dl-notice { max-width: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 64px; font: 14px/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #444; background: #fffbe6; }
.bl-dl-notice p { margin: 4px 0; }
.bl-sheet { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; }
@media (max-width: 820px) { .bl-sheet { width: auto !important; padding: 24px 16px !important; } .bl-dl-notice { padding: 12px 16px; } }
@page { size: 816px 1056px; margin: 0 0 40px; @bottom-center { content: "非官方译文 · v1.0 · 以原文为准"; font: 10px sans-serif; color: #888; } }
@media print { body { background: #fff; } }
.bl-sheet { width: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 56px 64px 64px; background: #fff; color: #000; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: "Times New Roman", "Songti SC", "Noto Serif CJK SC", serif; }
.bl-sheet .style1, .bl-sheet .style1 * { font-family: Palatino, "Palatino Linotype", "Book Antiqua", "URW Palladio L", "Songti SC", "Noto Serif CJK SC", serif; }
.bl-sheet h1 { font-size: 2em; margin: 0.67em 0; font-weight: bold; }
.bl-sheet h2 { font-size: 1.5em; margin: 0.83em 0; font-weight: bold; }
.bl-sheet h3 { font-size: 1.17em; margin: 1em 0; font-weight: bold; }
.bl-sheet .bl-tr { margin-inline-start: 0.5em; }
.bl-sheet .bl-tr-block { display: block; margin: 0.4em 0 0; }
</style></head>
<body>
<section class="bl-dl-notice">
<p><strong>非官方中文译文</strong>：A Sample Essay，Jane Doe（简·多伊），2020-01-01 发表。原文：<a href="https://example.com/essay.html">https://example.com/essay.html</a></p>
<p>翻译方式：视觉回归测试用的样例（tools/bilingual-import/testdata/sample.html 去掉图片）。 原文采集时间：2026-10-20 08:00:00+00:00。译文版本：v1.0。</p>
