<div class="bl-sheet"><style>.bl-sheet .style1 { font-family: Palatino; } .bl-sheet h1, .bl-sheet h2 { color: #222; }</style>
<h1>A Sample Essay<span class="bl-tr" lang="zh-CN">一篇样例短文</span></h1>
<h2>Jane Doe<span class="bl-tr" lang="zh-CN">简·多伊</span></h2>
<p class="style1">Plain text with <i>italics</i>, a <a href="https://example.com/x">link</a>, a star * and $5 &lt;tag&gt;. A quote ``like this" here.<span class="bl-tr bl-tr-block" lang="zh-CN">纯文本，带*斜体*、链接、星号和 5 美元。</span></p>
<p>1984. was a year.<span class="bl-tr bl-tr-block" lang="zh-CN">1984 年是一年。</span></p>
<p>No translation here.</p>
</div>
